    <!-- Privacy notice -->
    <string name="aviso_privacidad_titulo">Privacy notice</string>
    <string name="aviso_privacidad_texto">Gota de Vida stores your name, email, phone number, blood type, date of birth, weight, sex for medical criteria and an approximate location (about 100 meters, never your address).\n\nWe only use them to know whether you can donate and to alert you about matching blood emergencies near you.\n\nA hospital only sees how far away you are. They see your name and phone number only if you accept an emergency.\n\nYou can correct your data at any time from Settings → Edit my profile.\n\nThis is the school prototype notice; a data protection specialist must review it before the app is used with real people.</string>

